@startuml Tseten End-to-End Semantic Search
!define RECTANGLE_WIDTH 280
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam wrapWidth 250
skinparam maxMessageSize 200

title Tseten - End-to-End: Semantic Search Workflow

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #6A1B9A
    ActorBorderColor #4A148C
    LifeLineBorderColor #4A148C
    ParticipantBorderColor #6A1B9A
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #F3E5F5
}

actor "User" as user
box "Angular Frontend" #E8F5E9
    participant "SearchComponent" as ui
    participant "HttpClient" as http
end box
box "ASP.NET Backend" #E3F2FD
    participant "SoftwareRequirementsController" as controller
    participant "SearchSoftwareRequirementsHandler" as handler
    participant "EmbeddingService" as embeddingService
end box
box "Data Stores" #FFF3E0
    participant "VectorDbContext\n(EF Core)" as vectorDb
    database "SQL Server\n(Embeddings)" as sqlServer
    participant "TsetenContext" as couchContext
    database "Couchbase Lite" as couchbase
end box

== User Performs Semantic Search ==

user -> ui : Enter search query:\n"user authentication and security"
activate ui

user -> ui : Click "Search"

ui -> ui : Build request:\nquery, pageNumber=1,\npageSize=10,\nsimilarityThreshold=0.7

ui -> http : GET /api/softwarerequirements/search\n?query=...&pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
activate http

http -> controller : HTTP GET with query params
activate controller

controller -> controller : Authenticate & authorize

controller -> handler : Send(SearchSoftwareRequirementsRequest)
activate handler

handler -> embeddingService : GenerateEmbedding(query)
activate embeddingService

embeddingService -> embeddingService : Tokenize query text

embeddingService -> embeddingService : Generate 384-dimensional\nvector embedding

embeddingService --> handler : float[] queryVector
deactivate embeddingService

handler -> vectorDb : SearchBySimilarity(\nqueryVector,\nthreshold,\npageNumber,\npageSize)
activate vectorDb

vectorDb -> vectorDb : Calculate cosine similarity:\nfor each embedding in DB

note right of vectorDb
**Cosine Similarity Formula**
similarity = (A · B) / (||A|| * ||B||)

Where:
- A = query vector
- B = stored embedding vector
- · = dot product
- ||x|| = vector magnitude

Range: -1 to 1
(1 = identical, 0 = orthogonal)
end note

vectorDb -> sqlServer : Query:\nSELECT Id, SoftwareRequirementId,\nEmbedding, Similarity\nWHERE Similarity > threshold\nORDER BY Similarity DESC\nPaginated
activate sqlServer

sqlServer -> sqlServer : Vector similarity computation\n(optimized with indexing)

sqlServer --> vectorDb : List of (Id, SoftwareRequirementId,\nSimilarity score)
deactivate sqlServer

vectorDb --> handler : SearchResultDto[]\n(with scores)
deactivate vectorDb

loop For each result

    handler -> couchContext : GetDocument<SoftwareRequirement>\n(softwareRequirementId)
    activate couchContext
    
    couchContext -> couchbase : Retrieve document by ID
    activate couchbase
    
    couchbase --> couchContext : JSON document
    deactivate couchbase
    
    couchContext -> couchContext : Deserialize to\nSoftwareRequirement
    
    couchContext --> handler : SoftwareRequirement object
    deactivate couchContext
    
    handler -> handler : Enrich result with:\n- Full description\n- Acceptance criteria\n- Can implement/test flags\n- Similarity score

end

handler -> handler : Build SearchSoftwareRequirementsResponse:\n- Results array\n- TotalCount\n- PageNumber, PageSize

handler --> controller : Response with\npaginated results
deactivate handler

controller --> http : 200 OK\n(SearchSoftwareRequirementsResponse)
deactivate controller

http --> ui : Observable<Response>
deactivate http

ui -> ui : response.subscribe()

ui -> ui : Display results:\n- Requirement cards\n- Similarity scores\n- Highlighted matches\n- Pagination controls

ui --> user : Show search results\nordered by relevance
deactivate ui

== User Navigates Through Pages ==

user -> ui : Click "Next Page"
activate ui

ui -> ui : Increment pageNumber

ui -> http : GET /api/softwarerequirements/search\n?query=...&pageNumber=2&pageSize=10
activate http

note over http, handler
Same flow as above,
but with pageNumber=2

Returns next page of results
based on similarity ranking
end note

http --> ui : Page 2 results
deactivate http

ui --> user : Display page 2
deactivate ui

note bottom of sqlServer
**Embedding Sync**
Embeddings are populated via:
POST /api/softwarerequirements/embeddings/import

This should be called:
- After creating requirements
- After updating requirements
- Periodically for sync

Generates embeddings from:
- Description text
- Acceptance criteria text
end note

note right of ui
**Search Features**
- Semantic (meaning-based) search
- Not keyword matching
- Finds similar concepts
- Pagination support
- Configurable threshold
- Filter by implementable/testable

Example:
Query: "login security"
Matches: "user authentication",
"credential validation", 
"access control"
end note

@enduml
